    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring clouds over the sky</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				944b26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινέφει ὁ Ζεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. [ἄνεμος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Vent.</u>
